      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effects of carisoprodol and a placebo were compared in a sample of 60 patients with the clinical diagnosis of myofascial pain-dysfunction syndrome using double-blind design. Carisoprodol failed to show a significantly greater effect than the placebo. The side effects were about the same with both agents."},
